Rigel — Third-party notices
============================

FFmpeg
------
Rigel bundles FFmpeg static libraries (libavformat, libavcodec, libavutil,
libswresample, libswscale) built for iOS from the official FFmpeg source.

License: GNU Lesser General Public License version 3 (LGPL-3.0), or any later
version. FFmpeg source code is available at https://ffmpeg.org/ .
The build configuration used is in scripts/build-ffmpeg.sh.

Object code of the FFmpeg libraries is dynamically linked at application
runtime via a separate framework target. In accordance with LGPL-3.0, the
complete corresponding source code and the build scripts are offered above,
and the relinked object files may be obtained from the project maintainers
by request.
